    "obs_and_metrics": [],
    "innovation": "This review paper synthesizes findings from five recent observational studies to produce a consensus estimate for tropical low-cloud feedback, concluding that it is positive (0.25 \u00b1 0.18 W m\u207b\u00b2 K\u207b\u00b9) and that models with negative feedbacks are implausible.",
